property done, waitingline, ms
global glob

on startStep me
  [  0] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  1] setprop 66 .............................. done = 0
  [  3] getglobal 8 ............................. <glob>
  [  5] getchainedprop 9 ........................ <glob.managers>
  [  7] getchainedprop 10 ....................... <glob.managers.game>
  [  9] getobjprop 94 ........................... <glob.managers.game.waitingGroups>
  [ 11] setprop 93 .............................. waitingline = glob.managers.game.waitingGroups
  [ 13] getmovieprop 90 ......................... <the milliSeconds>
  [ 15] pushint16 2000 .......................... <2000>
  [ 18] add ..................................... <the milliSeconds + 2000>
  [ 19] setprop 89 .............................. ms = the milliSeconds + 2000
  [ 21] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 23] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <1>
  [ 25] extcall 44 .............................. return 1
  [ 27] ret
end

on checkDone me
  [  0] getprop 66 .............................. <done>
  [  2] getprop 93 .............................. <waitingline>
  [  4] pusharglist 1 ........................... <waitingline>
  [  6] extcall 26 .............................. <voidp(waitingline)>
  [  8] or ...................................... <done or voidp(waitingline)>
  [  9] jmpifz [ 16] ............................ if done or voidp(waitingline) then
  [ 12] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 14] extcall 44 .............................. return 
  [ 16] getmovieprop 90 ......................... <the milliSeconds>
  [ 18] getprop 89 .............................. <ms>
  [ 20] gt ...................................... <the milliSeconds > ms>
  [ 21] getprop 93 .............................. <waitingline>
  [ 23] getobjprop 59 ........................... <waitingline.count>
  [ 25] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 27] eq ...................................... <waitingline.count = 2>
  [ 28] and ..................................... <(the milliSeconds > ms) and (waitingline.count = 2)>
  [ 29] setprop 66 .............................. done = (the milliSeconds > ms) and (waitingline.count = 2)
  [ 31] getprop 66 .............................. <done>
  [ 33] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <done>
  [ 35] extcall 44 .............................. return done
  [ 37] ret
end
